---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — PetPomo">
  <article class="grid gap-4">
    <header>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">About PetPomo</h1>
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
        A pomodoro timer with a cat who naps while you work.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="pp-card p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-2 font-bold">How it works</h2>
      <ul class="grid gap-1.5 text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
        <li>· Start a focus session and Mochi curls up to sleep.</li>
        <li>· When the bell rings she stretches awake and celebrates — you earn coins.</li>
        <li>· Every focus session makes her hungrier. During breaks, drag a snack onto her.</li>
        <li>· Stroke her for a second to get purring and hearts. A quick poke starts a game.</li>
        <li>· Ignore two breaks in a row and she gets sad. So does abandoning a session.</li>
        <li>· Spend coins in the shop on scenes, themes, cats and better snacks.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="pp-card p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-2 font-bold">Your data</h2>
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
        Everything lives in this browser's local storage — there is no account and nothing is uploaded. The timer
        stores an absolute end time, so it stays accurate through refreshes, backgrounded tabs and laptop sleep.
        Cloud sync is opt-in: turn it on in <a href="/settings" class="underline">Settings</a> and your save is
        keyed by a random code that only you hold.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="pp-card p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-2 font-bold">Built with</h2>
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
        Astro (static) · Preact · Tailwind CSS · GSAP · Web Audio · Cloudflare Pages. The cat and the four scenes
        are hand-authored SVG, inlined into the bundle so the whole game works offline after the first load. Every
        sound effect is synthesized in the browser — no audio files are shipped.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="pp-card p-5">
      <h2 class="mb-2 font-bold">Accessibility</h2>
      <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">
        Reduced motion is honoured automatically from your OS setting, and can be forced on in Settings — it
        disables parallax, particles and every looping animation while keeping each pose readable. Audio starts
        muted. All controls are keyboard reachable.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
